        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 0128 Floor Mounted Center Hung Pivot Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese floor mounted center hung door pivots are engineered for durability on interior doors weighing up to 250 pounds. Set includes <a href=\"/products/center-hung-top-pivot-hinge-abh-0320\">ABH 0320 top pivot</a> and <a href=\"/products/floor-mounted-center-hung-bottom-pivot-abh-0128b-us32d\">ABH 0128B bottom pivot</a> with installation hardware.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0128-pivot_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH 0128 Floor Mounted Center Hung Pivot Set Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe bottom door pivot is mounted to the floor. Top pivot is mortised into the door's header.  <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Door Pivots</b></a> are Made in the USA to insure high quality. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH 0128 Center Hung Pivot Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 250 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Interior Door Size: Up to 3'6\" x 8'6\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise, Center Hung</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Pivot: Floor Mounted</li>\r\n<li>Top Pivot: Walking beam type hinge</li>\r\n<li>Dress plate provided for jamb portion</li>\r\n<li><b>Non-Handed, Reversible </b></li>\r\n<li>BHMA/ANSI C07032/3530</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0128-install.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0128 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0128-template.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0128 Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually <b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Floor Mounted Center Hung Pivot Set, ABH 0128",
                "description": "ABH 0128 floor mounted center hung door pivots are engineered for durability on interior doors weighing up to 250 pounds. Set includes top and bottom pivots with installation hardware. Available in 8 different finish colors and Made in the USA.",
